{11}{Is there anything I should know to help me?}{}{5}{}{15}{}
{15}{Just be alert. We have no idea how they are getting inside here. One might almost think they were using magick, but they would either need to be extremely foolish or possessed of an extreme intestinal fortitude.}{Just be alert. We have no idea how they are getting inside here. One might almost think they were using magick, but they would either need to be extremely foolish or possessed of an extreme intestinal fortitude.}{}{}{}{}
{16}{Why do you say that?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{20}{There's quite a bit of machinery around here to be attempting to use magick to get inside. They could end up inside a wall, or some such nonsense. At any rate, the factory floor is all yours. If you encounter the saboteurs and can't take care of them yourself, try to lead them out here and we'll help you with them.}{There's quite a bit of machinery around here to be attempting to use magick to get inside. They could end up inside a wall, or some such nonsense. At any rate, the factory floor is all yours. If you encounter the saboteurs and can't take care of them yourself, try to lead them out here and we'll help you with them.}{}{}{}{gf2460 1}
{21}{Will do.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{25}{Okay, idiot, the factory floor is back there. That is your area, understand?}{Okay, idiot, the factory floor is back there. That is your area, understand?}{}{}{}{}
{26}{No.}{}{-4}{}{30}{}
{30}{Well, go back there, anyway.}{Well, go back there, anyway.}{}{}{}{gf2460 1}
